{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 7529, "capacity": 9, "raw_hex": "5f73696e5f66616465", "baseline_text": "_sin_fade", "kind": "ascr", "source": "_sin_fade", "pointer_offset": 7176, "unit": "dialogue:c178046fa6cd98f0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 9397, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f0b5f158f0b6f0be81b8f167f0a7f158f14e81b82f2ff15af947f0bcf3e1f1daf8c8f249f1aef0bcf48381b8", "baseline_text": "오노히코∈키쿠노조∈//어서 시민들을 피난시켜∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "斧彦∈　菊之丞∈//はやく市民を避難させるのよ！", "pointer_offset": 7180, "unit": "dialogue:a9ad655c26311989", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 7586, "capacity": 66, "raw_hex": "f2c9f984f154f15af0ef8143f0bef2b5f27a81b82f2ff0faf7d1f1f9f0dbf9daf273f274f0af81482f2ffa53f249f1aef3d5f261f8a4f2e6fa7cf94af154f15a8148", "baseline_text": "알고 있어요，코토님∈//자…당신들 괜찮아？//저 피난처까지 달릴 수 있어？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "わかってるわ、琴さま！//ほら……アナタたち大丈夫？//あの避難所まで走れる？", "pointer_offset": 7184, "unit": "dialogue:f1be4c5acb86c0ca", "prior_review": "번역 검수"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 7661, "capacity": 52, "raw_hex": "f0cffa9bf1cef0f381432f2ff0b2f2a5f0a2f8a3f9d7f1e2f1d5f0ef81b82f2ff0dff944f1d9f56ef94bf186f27cf0f1f0ef81b8", "baseline_text": "다친 분은，//이쪽으로 와 주세요∈//제가 치료해 드릴게요∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ケガをした人は、//こっちに来てくださーい！//わたしが手当てしますからぁ∈", "pointer_offset": 7188, "unit": "dialogue:eb07227d3f9fbd2e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 7734, "capacity": 34, "raw_hex": "f9bcf8cff147f1bcf0c781b82f2ff0adf14ef14ff150f8b2f0b5f984f154f15a81b8", "baseline_text": "둘 다 서둘러∈//마조기병이 오고 있어∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "二人とも急ぐのよ∈//魔操機兵が来てるわ！", "pointer_offset": 7192, "unit": "dialogue:03e2850f59c66a15", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 7775, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f28dfb68f0f4f1fcf34d81b82f2ff0fa8143f0b1f8e7f2b1f2b2f0af81b8", "baseline_text": "얼른 도망쳐∈//자，나를 붙잡아∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "はやく逃げるのよ！//ほら、アタシにつかまって∈", "pointer_offset": 7196, "unit": "dialogue:125a03973934bf16", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 7822, "capacity": 30, "raw_hex": "f55ef0aff0aff0aff0af81b82f2ff0b2f2a5f0a2f8a3f1d7f0ef816081b8", "baseline_text": "꺄아아아아∈//이쪽으로 와요～∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "きゃぁぁぁ∈//こっちに来ますーっ！", "pointer_offset": 7200, "unit": "dialogue:5f3d5284ea28f36e", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0008", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 7857, "capacity": 9, "raw_hex": "5f706c61795f62676d", "baseline_text": "_play_bgm", "kind": "ascr", "source": "_play_bgm", "pointer_offset": 7204, "unit": "dialogue:182bd031781db09f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0009", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 9446, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f1c2f47ef0e28143f1f7f151f0a5f0a881b82f2ff0bcf3e1f1daf8e1f249f9aef1c2f0a3f0e72f2ff24cf1acf0a5f957f1c8f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "경찰대，전진하라∈//시민들의 피난 경로를//확보하는 거다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "警官隊、前進しろ∈//市民の避難経路を//確保するんだ！", "pointer_offset": 7208, "unit": "dialogue:29b1592abbc9169f", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0010", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 7920, "capacity": 9, "raw_hex": "5f73696e5f66616465", "baseline_text": "_sin_fade", "kind": "ascr", "source": "_sin_fade", "pointer_offset": 7212, "unit": "dialogue:c178046fa6cd98f0", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0011", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 7930, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f1bef14ff944f2d5f293f3d5f0cf81b82f2ff1adf8aef1c8f0aef157f7d12f2ff1adf8aef49df0a2f8a3f0a4f167f957f1c8f14881b8", "baseline_text": "여기가 승부처다∈//우리 거리는…//우리 손으로 지키는 거야∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ここが正念場だぞ∈//俺たちの街は……//自分の手で守るんだ！", "pointer_offset": 7216, "unit": "dialogue:7c68b8041258fe54", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0012", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 7989, "capacity": 36, "raw_hex": "f645f7d12f2ff1e2f7d1f1e2f15df0a5f8a4f0adf0a881b82f2ff3a8f1f7f0a5f0a881b8", "baseline_text": "윽…//주…주춤하지 마라∈//응전하라∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ぐはっ……//ひ……ひるむな∈//応戦しろ！", "pointer_offset": 7220, "unit": "dialogue:131bd6d7a096c0c5", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0013", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 8030, "capacity": 58, "raw_hex": "f16bf0aef0a5f8a4f0ad8143f142f0b2f1d981b82f2ff1f9f0db8143fb57f26af3d5f1442f2ff0affb74f8cff45af8a4f287f2e9f276f0af81b8", "baseline_text": "무리하지 마，유이치∈//당신，등 상처가//아직 다 낫지 않았잖아∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "無理しないの、雄一ちゃん∈//あなた、背中のキズが、//完治してないんでしょ∈", "pointer_offset": 7224, "unit": "dialogue:82a068d4b766b538", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0014", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 8105, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f26af17cf1b5f15af7d12f2ff8b2f0dff0f4f157f7d12f2ff1adf0aef944f0a4f167f957f1c8f14881b8", "baseline_text": "상관없어…//이 제도는…//우리가 지키는 거야∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "かまうものか……//この帝都は……//俺たちが守るんだ∈", "pointer_offset": 7228, "unit": "dialogue:a8267d76f54cf095", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0015", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 9501, "capacity": 72, "raw_hex": "f0f1f0cff144f7d12f2ff1adf0aef1daf1acf0cff0f4f7d1f184f34ff0aaf0c7f98cf1bdf25ef0c82f2ff0a5f984f154f957f1d6f0a1f8f4f154f0a2f0b8fa61f263f0b2f148f7d1", "baseline_text": "게다가…//우리들보다도…고통스러운 싸움을//하고 있는 녀석도 있으니까 말이야…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "それに……//俺たちよりも……苦しい戦いを//しているヤツもいるしな……", "pointer_offset": 7232, "unit": "dialogue:3d091ad9130f849c", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0016", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 8227, "capacity": 56, "raw_hex": "f7d1f0b5f0b5f144f0ab81b82f2ff0abf0baf0a6f957f362f3bbf0cf81b82f2ff293f35cf1a9f0cf81b8f0c9f186f8bcf0b2f2c6f0a881b8", "baseline_text": "…오오가미∈//미카사는 맡겼다∈//부탁한다∈반드시 이겨라∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……大神∈//ミカサはまかせた！//頼む∈　絶対に勝てよーっ∈", "pointer_offset": 7236, "unit": "dialogue:12b3d3a19cf4fd22", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0017", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 8286, "capacity": 62, "raw_hex": "f0ecf8b2f0e2faa4f28df0adf8b1f1b7f8f3f1c8f148f7d12f2ff0b2f0e2f0a3f0a8f1c78143f0a4f26af0b9f0f42f2ff26af1f9f9a9f249f14bf144f7d1", "baseline_text": "적이 대체 얼마나 많은 거야…//이대로라면，지상에도//상당한 피해가…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "なんて敵の数だ……//この調子だと、地上にも//かなりの被害が……", "pointer_offset": 7240, "unit": "dialogue:e4d03fffe83833a7", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0018", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 8349, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f0a4f26af8e1f271f0f9f15781432f2ff16bf0a6f257f261f7d1", "baseline_text": "지상의 모두는，//무사할까…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "地上のみんなは、//無事だろうか……", "pointer_offset": 7244, "unit": "dialogue:4f01ab3d188dbc7a", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0019", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 8384, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "73655f65765f343032632e736e64", "baseline_text": "se_ev_402c.snd", "kind": "ascr", "source": "se_ev_402c.snd", "pointer_offset": 7248, "unit": "dialogue:b2a5becd38365bfa", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
