{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0046", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 8703, "capacity": 16, "raw_hex": "657630343030325f73625f322e6d626f", "baseline_text": "ev04002_sb_2.mbo", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ev04002_sb_2.mbo", "pointer_offset": 7356, "unit": "dialogue:55da111e8e44d1f6", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0047", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 8720, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f7d1f186f2e0f95af14cf0a981442f2ff0b5f0a7f9acf0b1f144f148f0aa81b82f2ff0abf0baf0a6f8e7f0d0f1b2f0f2f29ef0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "…드디어 왔군．//오쿠보 나가야스∈//미카사를 돌려받겠다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "……ついに来たぞ。//大久保長安∈//ミカサを返してもらう∈", "pointer_offset": 7360, "unit": "dialogue:43b1365d5c0cc6d9", "prior_review": "재검수2"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0048", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 8777, "capacity": 24, "raw_hex": "f0c1f0cf8143f0b1f144f148f0aaf7d1f2d5f293f0cf81b8", "baseline_text": "간다，나가야스…승부다∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "いくぞ長安……//勝負だ！", "pointer_offset": 7364, "unit": "dialogue:b3112ea8b492a4de", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0049", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 8802, "capacity": 26, "raw_hex": "f24cf24df8b6f1e1f2e9f15af7d12f2ff14bfb90f28af14481ac", "baseline_text": "확실히 맞았어…//해낸 건가〓", "kind": "ascr", "source": "手応えはあった……//やったか〓", "pointer_offset": 7368, "unit": "dialogue:0acd55659e75b27b", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0050", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 8833, "capacity": 46, "raw_hex": "f15df15ff15af0a8f7d1f0baf168f0a8f0e7f7d12f2ff0b1f8e1f254f0c8f7d1f16bf0e2f8a3f379f0aff0a8f7d1", "baseline_text": "춤추어라…카구라를…//나의 혼을…무대로 삼아라…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "舞え……神楽を……//我が魂を……舞台とせよ……", "pointer_offset": 7372, "unit": "dialogue:68578f5e7c718746", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0051", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 8880, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f0b1f7d1f181f0cff7d1f2aaf293f8e1f1abf279f146f7d12f2ff0dbf0c8f7d1f156f0c7f1daf0b2f157f7d12f2ff462f0c8f7d1f19cf9b2f1e2f0aef0a8f7d1", "baseline_text": "나…연다…명부의 바위문…//신을…불러들이는…//몸을…내려 주리라…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "我……開く……冥府の岩戸……//神を……誘う……//体を……授けん……", "pointer_offset": 7376, "unit": "dialogue:21ea613e10ca13be", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN#0052", "file": "SLG/G04/E/EV04002.SBN", "offset": 8947, "capacity": 14, "raw_hex": "66786e346330335f30332e626531", "baseline_text": "fxn4c03_03.be1", "kind": "ascr", "source": "fxn4c03_03.be1", "pointer_offset": 7380, "unit": "dialogue:210aba02b10a7532", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
